{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43319","headline":"龙池春草 · 宋迪","name":"龙池春草","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤阙韶光遍，龙池草色匀。\n烟波全让绿，堤柳不争新。\n翻叶迎红日，飘香借白苹。\n幽姿偏占暮，芳意欲留春。\n已胜生金埓，长思藉玉轮。\n翠华如见幸，正好及兹辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋迪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}